["I need to make 24 using 9, 5, 6, 3 exactly once each, with +, -, *, / operators.\n\nLet me think through various combinations:\n\n- 9 * 3 = 27, 27 - 5 = 22, 22 + 6 = 28. No.\n- 9 * 3 = 27, 27 - 6 = 21, 21 + 5 = 26. No.\n- 9 * 3 = 27, 27 - 5 - 6 = 16. No.\n- 9 * 3 = 27, 27 + 5 - 6 = 26. No.\n- 9 * 3 = 27, 27 - 6/5... no.\n- 6 * 5 = 30, 30 - 9 + 3 = 24. Yes! Let me verify: 30 - 9 = 21, 21 + 3 = 24. ✓\n\nSo 6 * 5 - 9 + 3 = 24.\n\nLet me verify: 6 * 5 = 30, 30 - 9 = 21, 21 + 3 = 24. ✓\n\nThat works!\n"]